+4. Click the Login button by selector, not by coordinate — a fixed position misses whenever the
+   window size, zoom, or a banner shifts the layout:
+
+```javascript
+// javascript_tool — click Login
+const btn = document.querySelector('button[type="submit"], input[type="submit"]')
+  || [...document.querySelectorAll('button')].find(b => /log ?in|sign ?in/i.test(b.textContent));
+if (!btn) throw new Error('LOGIN_BUTTON_NOT_FOUND');
+btn.click();
+'clicked: ' + btn.textContent.trim();
+```
+
+   Then `wait` 3 seconds. If this throws `LOGIN_BUTTON_NOT_FOUND`, the page did not render the
+   form — screenshot before retrying; do not fall back to a coordinate click.
+5. Confirm success: page title should change to "My Dashboard". If it does not, login failed —
+   record `loginOk: false` and carry it into the Step 2.5 gate.
 
